<title>UK: Copel sets $150 million eight-year bond.</title>
<headline>Copel sets $150 million eight-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's state power firm Cia Paranaense de Energia (Copel) has launched a $150 million Eurobond, joint lead managers Santander Investment and Salomon Brothers said.</p>
<p>The notes will mature in 2005 with a put and call in 2002. Pricing will be announced later on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7748</p>
